I would say "mi'a pilno lo metlyxalka remoi pau le cipra" 
(or "...repaumoi..."). Jbofi'e glosses "pau" as "question follows", but since 
it's in UI, it modifies the preceding word if it isn't at the beginning of 
the sentence.

